<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Frost Mage in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>Our Tier Set this phase for Frost is great, as it increases the damage output of the specialization without any need for active changes to gameplay.<br/>The two-piece just adds damage to your Ice Lance whenever by 20% when Brain Freeze is consumed. The four-piece creates a chance to proc an icy boulder on the target whenever Brain Freeze is also consumed.<br/>
<br/>This is amazing because it keeps the spec just as simple as usual, and doesn't require any adaptation to benefit from it.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-16">
